        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Artists Emma Jarrett and Sarah Guest are hosting this wonderful workshop, ArtAsResilience, at the Sunset Theatre in Wells on November 21st and 22nd, 2025.  Play in creativity, and learn about your nervous-system needs as you nurture all that you are in the artful wilds of Wells.  Writing &amp; d"
      }
