      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "For the last few years, it has become a tradition at the Sunset Theatre to screen some of the Oscar Nominated Films in the lead up and beyond  Oscar Night. (This year  the Oscars are on March 2nd) .   Here is the first of our Oscar Weekend Line Up.   Friday, February 14th @ 7PM -  Conclave   Running"
