        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "On August 18 we are  hosting a staged reading of a New Play created through our Sunset Theatre Exploration Series.    August 18th • 7 PM  –   Holding the Door Open for Famous People   – Written and Performed by Karen Planden • Dramaturgy and Direction by Camille Mitchell.  The Sunset Theatre Explora"
