        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us this weekend for the screening of two much beloved 80s \"Classic\" films and a Round Robin Movie Trivia Contest after each film.   Friday, July 19th @ 8PM • Ferris Bueller's Day Off  Sat. July 20th @ 8PM - Back to the Future  Tickets $10/film for Age 14 +, $5.00 for Wells Kids  About"
