        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "THIS SHOW IS FOR ADULTS ONLY (18+)  Since we first heard about this award-winning hit show, we’ve been keen to bring Canadian Clown Artist Candy Roberts to the Sunset stage: she’s fucking brilliant, and we are lucky to have her.  (Yes, we used the F-word, because this show is for adults.)  Roberts a"
