      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "95% SOLD OUT • AS OF DECEMBER 12TH   EMAIL SUNSETTHEATRE@GMAIL.COM FOR TICKET AVAILABILITY  Save the date! Our 1st Christmas Cabaret since 2018!   Join us for some yuletide comedy, music and more - all created and performed by local Theatre Artists and Musicians.   Cabaret has been our main Fundrais"
