        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Silent Film as it was meant to be heard.    Enjoy original live accompaniment arranged &amp; composed by Patrick Courtin for three classic Buster Keaton short films:   The Scarecrow  (1920),  Cops  (1922), and  One Week  (1920)."
      }
