        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sawney’s Legacy tells the story of James Anderson, the first published poet of note in British Columbia.    This play is written and performed by Brendan Bailey with Direction by Dirk Van Stralen. It was developed in part through The Sunset Theatre’s annual Exploration Series, and will be presented"
