      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tomatoes Tried to Kill Me But Banjos Saved My Life  is a heartfelt passion project that began in 2018 as a nudge after Keith Alessi’s life took a major turn. He shares his exceptional true story of leaving the corporate world behind to follow his true passion—playing the banjo!  When faced with a ca"
