      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "SAVE THE DATE • Wednesday, April 19th, 2023 is National Canadian Film Day.  To celebrate the 10th Anniversary of National Canadian Film Day the Sunset Theatre will be joining  hundreds of Theatres across Canada for the all day and evening All You Can Watch Buffet of Canadian Films.   Tickets:   #Pay"
