      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:   $15.00  Showtime:  8PM to 10PM (2 Acts/1 intermission) followed by an Opening Night Party for Speakeasy Festival!   We are kicking off our inaugural Speakeasy Festival with the Sunset Cabaret!  Cabaret is turning Sweet 16 this summer, and we can’t wait to gather and celebrate this much be"
