      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Please Join us on Saturday, March 12th for a reading of a new play, Postdiluvian, written and performed by Ryan Schmitt.  Date: Saturday, March 12  Time: 8PM Running Time: @ 75 to 90 minutes Tickets: By Donation PHO:  BC vaccine passports or other provincial proof of double vaccination and photo ID"
