      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Wes Anderson’s latest is a love letter to journalists set in an outpost of an American newspaper in the fictional 20th-century French city of Ennui-sur-Blasé that brings to life a collection of stories published in \"The French Dispatch.\"     Rating:   R (Language|Graphic Nudity|S"
      }
