      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us this long weekend for four fab films not to be missed!   Tickets:   $10/each or $15 for both films in one evening     IN THE HEIGHTS • 7PM • RATED PG 13     “Casting, choreography, songs, and story all come together In the Heights to offer pure joy in modern movie musical form.   Trailer:"
