      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "On Saturday, August 21st, join us for a fun night of 80s synth, signed music!   Island Mountain Arts is happy to present HALF/ASIAN with Amy the CODA at The Sunset Theatre, the first concert as part of Island Mountain Arts’ “Seasonal sWells,” a series of concerts that will be taking place through th"
