        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come check out a chicken waffle dinner hosted by Morsels Moveable Feast from 6PM to 8:30PM next to the Sunset, and then going us for A Quiet Place Part 2 at 8:30PM  Tickets:   $10 Showtime:   8:30 PM Running Time:   1 hour 37 minutes Rating:   PG-13  Genre:     Mystey &amp; Thriller, Horror Dire"
      }
