      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We are extremely grateful for all the support we’ve received following the March 24th break in at the Theatre. Richard Wright kindly started a GoFundMe page to help cover the cost of some of the items stolen and the cost of repairs. Thanks so much for your support.    https://www.gofundme.com/f/the-"
