      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:   $10 Running Time:   2 hours &amp; 32 minutes Trailer:    https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/ford_v_ferrari     American automotive designer Carroll Shelby and fearless British race car driver Ken Miles battle corporate interference, the laws of physics and their own personal demons to b"
