      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Our 2020 Season was lining up to be another great year, but of course then the world changed. Like every Theatre around the world, we had to temporarily close our doors on March 15th due to the Covid19 pandemic. We are working on our re-opening plans with guidance from the Canadian and BC Government"
      }
