        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:    $10.00 Running time:   65 minutes plus Q&amp;A  We are very happy to be able to re-schedule this public reading of Brendan Bailey’s play, Sawney’s Legacy, which was originally scheduled to be read on March 18, 2020.   Join us for the first public reading of Brendan’s new play, develo"
