        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Written &amp; Directed by Matthew MacKenzie • Starring Sheldon Elter • Featuring Skye Demas, Lara Ebata, Christine Sokaymoh Frederick, Zoe • Glassman, Rebecca Sadowski, Kendra Shorter, Shammy Belmore   Comically Dark. Unapologetically political. A play about pipelines.   “I’d never seen a play t"
