    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Not only is this evening our very popular Sunset Cabaret, but it also happens to be Chris Cooley’s 40th Birthday. Chris has been instrumental in organizing the Cabaret with Stu Cawood for quite a few years now. We are so grateful to all the work he has done for the Sunset over the years, and so let’"
